          </div>
          <div class="fc-info">
            <h4 class="fc-title">Introduction to Insurance</h4>
            <p class="fc-desc">Basics of insurance — learn the core principles that power risk protection.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fc-action">
            <a href="#" class="fc-btn start">Start</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fc-item">
          <div class="fc-img-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #4c1d95);">
            <div class="fc-img-text">Family Protection Risk</div>
            <div class="cl-play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:10px;height:10px;fill:white;margin-left:2px;"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
          </div>
          <div class="fc-info">
            <h4 class="fc-title">Family Protection Risk</h4>
            <p class="fc-desc">Identify risks facing families and recommend appropriate coverage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fc-action">
            <a href="#" class="fc-btn start">Start</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fc-item">
          <div class="fc-img-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1e3a8a);">
            <div class="fc-img-text">Small Business Risk</div>
            <div class="cl-play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:10px;height:10px;fill:white;margin-left:2px;"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
          </div>
          <div class="fc-info">
            <h4 class="fc-title">Small Business Risk</h4>
            <p class="fc-desc">Assess and mitigate risks for SMEs and entrepreneurs effectively.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fc-action">
            <a href="#" class="fc-btn start">Start</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fc-item">
          <div class="fc-img-wrap" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #c2410c);">
            <div class="fc-img-text">School Risk Advisory</div>
            <div class="cl-play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:10px;height:10px;fill:white;margin-left:2px;"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
          </div>
          <div class="fc-info">
            <h4 class="fc-title">School Risk Advisory</h4>
            <p class="fc-desc">Comprehensive risk assessment for educational institutions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fc-action">
            <a href="#" class="fc-btn start">Start</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Achievements -->
    <div>
      <div class="section-header">
        <h3 class="sec-title">Achievements</h3>
        <a href="#" class="sec-link">View All</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="ach-scroll">
        <!-- Ach 1 -->
        <div class="ach-item">
          <div class="ach-icon green">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="ach-text">
            <span class="ach-val">12</span>
            <span class="ach-lbl">Courses<br>Completed</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Ach 2 -->
